  "description": "Eliana, the eldest daughter of a poor aristocratic family, accepts Baron Karman's proposal for the support of her younger siblings and family, but as soon as she gets married, she hears a voice like a scoundrel. Besides, she was stigmatized as the stepmother by Sharchen's scheme. \n\nEliana, who could not be defeated like this, decides to actively use her stepmother's image to turn the crisis into an opportunity. \n\nHer goal is to become the queen of the harem. It is not for sweet love, but a shortcut to gaining power like war. Can she get revenge and find true love in this dangerous harem construction?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
